# r7-camera-black-libgstdroid). If the Phase 1 test confirms it is unusable,
# strip this in the next kernel pass. Costs nothing at runtime while unused.
# The repeater/TS-mux paths above stay stripped either way - those are
# screen-mirroring features, irrelevant to serving media over the network.
# r7-server: hardware video codec REMOVED (user decision 2026-08-12, after
# weighing it). Jellyfin does not need it: Direct Play (the client decodes)
